					"nextDialogs": [
						240050406,
						240050407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "洛薇"
				},
				{
					"id": 240050406,
					"content": "你只缺泡泡桔嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240050408
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 240050408,
					"content": "如果真的有泡泡桔的話，我倒是可以馬上做一批泡泡桔醬出來，其他的調味料也剩下一點…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240050409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路易"
				},
				{
					"id": 240050409,
					"content": "#好耶！{M#大哥哥}{F#大姐姐}最厲害了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240050410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "洛薇"
				},
				{
					"id": 240050410,
					"content": "#謝謝{M#大哥哥}{F#大姐姐}！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240050411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "韋呂"
				},
				{
					"id": 240050411,
					"content": "#真是不好意思，每次遇見我們的時候，都要麻煩{F#妳}{M#你}一次。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240050412,
						240050413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧雷勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 240050412,
					"content": "不用這麼客氣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240050414
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 240050414,
					"content": "好吧…我得向您學習才是，德勒呂叔叔也經常說我太古板了，如果未來也想做評論家的話，職業道路會很艱難…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240050415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧雷勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 240050415,
					"content": "咳！不說這些了，我會在這裡照顧他們的，泡泡桔的事就麻煩您了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "奧雷勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 240050413,
					"content": "可不能掃了興。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240050414
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 240050407,
					"content": "我可以去拿點泡泡桔回來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240050408
					]
				}
